<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;MICHEL GARDES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Michel Gardes is a former French politician who dedicated his life to public service, particularly in the area of pensions, and later retired to enjoy his pension while continuing to engage with his community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LYON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lyon is a quaint town in France where Michel Gardes lived and worked throughout his life."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH POLITICIAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"French politician describes Michel's role in the political sphere, highlighting his dedication and influence in French politics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1970S&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 1970s mark the beginning of Michel's political career, setting the stage for his future endeavors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL LEVEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local level refers to the starting point of Michel's political career, where he worked to address the concerns of his constituents."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1993 PENSION REFORM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 1993 pension reform was a significant legislative achievement for Michel, aimed at addressing the sustainability of the pension system."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL ASSEMBLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"National Assembly is the location where Michel conducted many of his political meetings and debates."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TECHNICIANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Technicians are a group of workers who look up and nod in unison when Michel gazes at them, indicating a professional relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"Technicians are the unsung heroes who keep France's infrastructure running smoothly, a group Michel had a special affinity for."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JACQUES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jacques is a technician Michel met in a café, representing the broader group of unsung workers Michel respects and advocates for."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORKING CLASS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Working class refers to the group Michel championed as a politician, emphasizing his commitment to the welfare of the working class."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RETIREMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Retirement marks the end of Michel's political career and the beginning of his life as a pensioner."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PENSION SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pension system is the framework Michel worked to strengthen and protect, ensuring the elderly could live with dignity and security."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONSTITUENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Constituents are the people Michel served in his political career, representing the community he worked to improve."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC SERVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public service is the core of Michel's career, reflecting his dedication to improving the lives of others."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Community refers to the group of people Michel engaged with, both during his political career and after retirement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;APPRENTICE ELECTRICIAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Apprentice electrician describes Michel's early career, highlighting his hands-on experience before entering politics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNSUNG HEROES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Unsung heroes refer to the technicians and other workers Michel admired and fought for, emphasizing their importance in society."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRATITUDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gratitude is the feeling Michel experienced when reflecting on the pension system he helped create, recognizing the respect and support of the French people."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOLIDARITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Solidarity is the bond Michel felt with the technicians and other workers, a connection forged through shared values and experiences."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HUMBLE BEGINNINGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Humble beginnings describe Michel's early life in a working-class family, influencing his career choices and values."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BUSTLING STREETS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bustling streets refer to the lively areas of Lyon where Michel often visited, symbolizing the vibrancy of the city."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAFÉ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Café is a place where Michel often met with people, including technicians and other community members."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUNSET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sunset marks the end of Michel's workday, symbolizing the transition from his political career to his life as a pensioner."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CROWDED CAFÉ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Crowded café is a specific place where Michel met with people, highlighting the social aspect of his life after retirement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRESHLY BREWED COFFEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Freshly brewed coffee is a symbol of comfort and familiarity for Michel, representing the daily routine he enjoyed after retirement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MICHEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Michel is a character who is deep in thought and brings a faint smile to his lips while drinking coffee."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COFFEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Coffee is the beverage Michel is drinking, which brings a faint smile to his lips."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GAZE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gaze is Michel's action that causes the technicians to react, indicating a form of communication or attention."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0467</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;MICHEL GARDES&quot;" target="&quot;LYON&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Michel Gardes lived and worked in Lyon, a town that played a significant role in his life and career."</data>
      <data key="d5">"residence, professional base"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MICHEL GARDES&quot;" target="&quot;FRENCH POLITICIAN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Michel Gardes held the role of French politician, dedicating his life to public service and making a difference in his community."</data>
      <data key="d5">"career, public service"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MICHEL GARDES&quot;" target="&quot;1970S&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Michel's political career began in the 1970s, marking the start of his journey in public service."</data>
      <data key="d5">"career start, political journey"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MICHEL GARDES&quot;" target="&quot;LOCAL LEVEL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Michel started his political career at the local level, working to address the concerns of his constituents."</data>
      <data key="d5">"local engagement, community service"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MICHEL GARDES&quot;" target="&quot;1993 PENSION REFORM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Michel played a key role in shaping the 1993 pension reform, a significant legislative achievement for him and the pension system."</data>
      <data key="d5">"legislative achievement, pension reform"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MICHEL GARDES&quot;" target="&quot;NATIONAL ASSEMBLY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Michel conducted many of his political meetings and debates at the National Assembly, a central location for his political activities."</data>
      <data key="d5">"political meetings, legislative work"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MICHEL GARDES&quot;" target="&quot;TECHNICIANS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Michel had a special affinity for the technicians who keep France's infrastructure running, advocating for their rights and interests."</data>
      <data key="d5">"affinity, advocacy"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TECHNICIANS&quot;" target="&quot;JACQUES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Jacques is a representative of the broader group of technicians Michel respects and advocates for, sharing a bond of hard work and dedication."</data>
      <data key="d5">"representative, solidarity"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TECHNICIANS&quot;" target="&quot;MICHEL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">12.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Michel's gaze causes the technicians to react, suggesting a supervisory or leadership role."</data>
      <data key="d5">"supervision, attention"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TECHNICIANS&quot;" target="&quot;GAZE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">5.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The technicians react to Michel's gaze, indicating a form of communication."</data>
      <data key="d5">"reaction, communication"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MICHEL&quot;" target="&quot;COFFEE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">5.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Michel is drinking coffee, which brings a faint smile to his lips."</data>
      <data key="d5">"enjoyment, drink"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0467</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
